":[],"fett":true},{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Pi-Beispiel","Code"],"zeilen":[["LED blinken (gpiozero)","from gpiozero import LED; from time import sleep\nled = LED(17)\nwhile True: led.toggle(); sleep(0.5)"],["Taster lesen","from gpiozero import Button; b = Button(2); b.wait_for_press()"],["Temperatur lesen","open('/sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone0/temp').read()  # /1000 = °C"]],"mono":[],"fett":true},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"merke","text":"Einrückung (4 Leerzeichen) **ist** die Blockstruktur. Mischung aus Tab und Leerzeichen → `IndentationError`."},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"tipp","text":"Fehlersuche: `print(type(x), x)`, oder im interaktiven Interpreter `python3 -i skript.py`."}],"siehe":["c","regex"],"symbol":"gehaeuse","gruppe":"Programmieren"},{"id":"c","titel":"C / Arduino-Spickzettel","kurz":"Typen, Operatoren, Bit-Operationen","tags":["c","arduino","cpp","bit","pinmode","datentyp","millis","esp32"],"bloecke":[{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Typ","Bytes (AVR / 32 Bit)","Bereich"],"zeilen":[["char / int8_t","1","−128 … 127"],["uint8_t / byte","1","0 … 255"],["int (AVR)","2","−32768 … 32767"],["int (ESP32/ARM)","4","±2,1 Mrd."],["uint16_t","2","0 … 65535"],["long / int32_t","4","±2,1 Mrd."],["uint32_t","4","0 … 4,29 Mrd."],["float","4","≈ 7 Stellen"],["double (AVR = float!)","4 / 8",""],["bool","1","true/false"]],"mono":[],"fett":true},{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Operation","Beispiel","Wirkung"],"zeilen":[["Bit setzen","x |= (1 << n)","Bit n = 1"],["Bit löschen","x &= ~(1 << n)","Bit n = 0"],["Bit umschalten","x ^= (1 << n)","Bit n invertieren"],["Bit prüfen","(x >> n) & 1","0 oder 1"],["Maske","x & 0x0F","unteres Nibble"],["Schieben","x << 2 / x >> 2","× 4 / ÷ 4"]],"mono":[1],"fett":true},{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Arduino-Funktion","Zweck"],"zeilen":[["pinMode(pin, OUTPUT)","Pin als Ausgang"],["digitalWrite(pin, HIGH)","Ausgang setzen"],["digitalRead(pin)","Eingang lesen"],["analogRead(A0)","ADC 0–1023"],["analogWrite(pin, 0–255)","PWM"],["delay(ms) / millis()","Warten / Zeit seit Start"],["Serial.begin(115200)","Seriell starten"],["Serial.println(x)","Ausgabe"],["map(x, a, b, c, d)","Bereich umrechnen"],["attachInterrupt(…)","Interrupt"]],"mono":[0],"fett":true},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"tipp","text":"**Nicht mit `delay()` blockieren:** `millis()` verwenden: `if (millis() - letzte >= 1000) { letzte = millis(); … }`."},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"warn","text":"`int` hat auf Arduino Uno nur 16 Bit – `60 * 1000` überläuft! `60000UL` (unsigned long) schreiben."}],"siehe":["zahlen:zahlen","python"],"symbol":"gehaeuse","gruppe":"Programmieren"},{"id":"bash","titel":"Bash-Skripte","kurz":"Variablen, Schleifen, Bedingungen","tags":["bash","shell","skript","script","schleife","variable","shebang"],"bloecke":[{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Thema","Beispiel"],"zeilen":[["Shebang","#!/bin/bash"],["Variable","name=\"Welt\"; echo \"Hallo $name\""],["Argumente","$1 $2 … $@ (alle) $# (Anzahl)"],["Befehlsausgabe","heute=$(date +%F)"],["if","if [ -f datei ]; then … fi"],["for","for f in *.txt; do echo \"$f\"; done"],["while","while true; do …; sleep 1; done"],["Funktion","f() { echo \"$1\"; }"],["Exit-Code","echo $?   (0 = erfolgreich)"],["Abbruch bei Fehler","set -euo pipefail"],["Standardwert","${var:-standard}"]],"mono":[1],"fett":true},{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Test","Bedeutung"],"zeilen":[["-f datei","Datei existiert"],["-d ordner","Ordner existiert"],["-z \"$s\"","String leer"],["-n \"$s\"","String nicht leer"],["$a -eq $b","Zahlen gleich (-ne, -lt, -gt, -le, -ge)"],["\"$a\" = \"$b\"","Strings gleich"],["-x datei","ausführbar"]],"mono":[],"fett":true},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"warn","text":"Variablen immer in **Anführungszeichen**: `rm \"$ordner\"/*`. Bei leerer Variable würde `rm $ordner/*` sonst `/*` löschen!"},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"tipp","text":"Skript ausführbar machen: `chmod +x skript.sh`, starten mit `./skript.sh`."}],"siehe":["befehle","chmod"],"symbol":"gehaeuse","gruppe":"Programmieren"},{"id":"regex","titel":"Reguläre Ausdrücke","kurz":"Muster, Gruppen, Beispiele","tags":["regex","regexp","reguläre ausdrücke","muster","grep","suchen"],"bloecke":[{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Muster","Bedeutung"],"zeilen":[[".","beliebiges Zeichen"],["^ / $","Zeilenanfang / -ende"],["*  +  ?","0+, 1+, 0 oder 1"],["{n,m}","n bis m Wiederholungen"],["[abc] / [a-z] / [^a]","Zeichenklasse / Bereich / Negation"],["\\d \\w \\s","Ziffer / Wortzeichen / Leerraum"],["( … )","Gruppe"],["a|b","oder"],["\\b","Wortgrenze"],["(?i)","Groß/Klein egal"]],"mono":[0],"fett":true},{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Ziel","Ausdruck"],"zeilen":[["IPv4 (grob)","\\b(\\d{1,3}\\.){3}\\d{1,3}\\b"],["Datum 2026-10-21","\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}"],["Uhrzeit","([01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d"],["E-Mail (grob)","[\\w.+-]+@[\\w-]+\\.[\\w.]+"],["Hex-Farbe","#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}"],["Zahl (mit Komma)","-?\\d+([.,]\\d+)?"],["Leerzeilen","^\\s*$"]],"mono":[1],"fett":true},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"tipp","text":"Zum Testen: `grep -E 'muster' datei` (erweiterte Regex) oder Python `re.findall(r'muster', text)`."},{"t":"hinweis","typ":"warn","text":"Regex für **HTML, E-Mail nach RFC, Zeitzonen** ist eine Falle – dafür gibt es Parser/Bibliotheken."}],"siehe":["python"],"symbol":"gehaeuse","gruppe":"Programmieren"},{"id":"sql","titel":"SQL & Datenbanken","kurz":"SELECT, JOIN, GROUP BY, SQLite","tags":["sql","sqlite","datenbank","select","insert","mariadb","mysql"],"bloecke":[{"t":"tabelle","kopf":["Befehl","Beispiel"],"zeilen":[["Tabelle anlegen","CREATE TABLE mess (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, zeit TEXT, wert REAL);"],["Einfügen","INSERT INTO mess (zeit, wert) VALUES ('2026-10-21', 21.5);"],["Abfragen","SELECT * FROM mess WHERE wert > 20 ORDER BY zeit DESC LIMIT 10;"],["Ändern","UPDATE mess SET wert = 22 WHERE id = 1;"],["Löschen","DELETE FROM mess WHERE id = 1;"],["Zählen","SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mess;"],["Mittelwert","SELECT AVG(wert), MIN(wert), MAX(wert) FROM mess;"],["Gruppieren","SELECT date(zeit), AVG(wert) FROM mess GROUP BY date(zeit);"],["Verbinden","SELECT * FROM a JOIN b ON a.id = b.a_id;"],["Index","CREATE INDEX idx ON 